Open Street Map
https://www.openstreetmap.org/about

OpenStreetMap is a free, editable map of the world built by a global community of volunteers.
Users collect, view, and share geographic data—such as roads, buildings, trails, and shops—under an open-content license.

Overpass-API
https://github.com/drolbr/Overpass-API
https://wiki.openstreetmap.org/wiki/Overpass_API

Read-only database engine that allows users to query and extract custom subsets of raw map data from Open Street Map.

